# SHA-256 of the tracked reference hull (the geometry every sweep validates
# against).  Pinned so an accidental in-repo Godzilla/sweep overwrite fails CI
# instead of silently corrupting downstream parses.
#
# Regenerate ONLY on an intentional hull redesign, in the same commit:
#     sha256sum in.mlt off1.mlt out.mlt > tests/fixtures/reference_hull.sha256
# (then restore this header)
